{"id":"ua1zqmda0k6luvzo0bs9qd8f1","title":"NIST 科学家利用量子技术验证位置","originalTitle":"Quantum physics can verify a person's location, researchers show","summary":"NIST 和其国际合作者利用量子技术首次证明了可以准确验证一个人的位置。通过量子位置验证（QPV）技术，研究人员可以在几秒钟内确定某人是否位于特定地点，从而防止远程欺诈行为。该技术有望在未来十年内应用于保护健康记录、防止黑客攻击等场景。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-quantum-physics-person.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T16:00:13.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T18:12:39.507Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T18:12:39.507Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"05c10efb-bc67-4267-8faa-877c76b848f5","title":"NIST首次用量子技术验证人类位置准确性"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"05c10efb-bc67-4267-8faa-877c76b848f5","title":"NIST首次用量子技术验证人类位置准确性"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"famRN5-4qQgI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}